# Bakeoff — classical vs ML, one protocol

- window: **2024-03-01 → 2025-12-31** (era5 truth), horizon **24 h**
- folds: **4 rolling-origin**, seeds: **[42, 7, 1234, 2024, 31337]** (deterministic models run once per fold)
- lower MAE is better; skill is `1 − MAE/MAE_persistence`, higher better

### study

| Rank | Tier | Model | MAE (m/s) | sd | RMSE | R² | Skill vs persistence |
|---:|:---|:---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 1 | 2 ML | `xgboost` | **0.8037** | 0.1023 | 1.0337 | 0.5886 | +0.386 |
